WEBVTT

00:03:58.202 --> 00:04:00.706
During that hard journey back to work,

00:04:00.730 --> 00:04:06.256
I learned the power of having
a culture of empathy in the workplace.

00:04:07.034 --> 00:04:08.185
Not sympathy,

00:04:08.209 --> 00:04:09.677
not compassion,

00:04:09.701 --> 00:04:10.899
but empathy.

00:04:11.683 --> 00:04:13.635
I came to believe

00:04:13.659 --> 00:04:18.586
that a workplace where empathy
is a core part of the culture,

00:04:18.610 --> 00:04:22.197
that is a joyful and productive workplace,

00:04:22.221 --> 00:04:25.466
and that workplace inspires
a great deal of loyalty.

00:04:26.610 --> 00:04:30.325
I believe there are three things
a company can do